  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop garlic.\n• In a medium saucepan, melt the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat. Cook garlic until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add jasmine rice, the water (for the rice) and a good pinch of salt. Bring to the boil.\n• Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 12 minutes, then remove from heat.\n• Keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10-15 minutes. TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64d082cc7befbd431bc7536d-db96aa00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the rice is cooking, thinly slice carrot into half-moons.\n• Trim and halve green beans.\n• Roughly chop Asian greens.\n• Cut lemon into wedges.\n• Cut firm tofu into 1cm chunks.\n• In a medium bowl, combine the plain flour and a pinch of salt. Add tofu, gently tossing to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64d082cc7befbd431bc7536d-6b737498.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a small bowl, combine hoisin sauce, the soy sauce, the water (for the sauce), the brown sugar, a squeeze of lemon juice and half the sesame seeds.\n• In a second small bowl, combine garlic aioli, remaining sesame seeds and a small splash of water.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64d082cc7befbd431bc7536d-2ab75e9f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook carrot and green beans, tossing, until softened, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add Asian greens and cook until softened, 1-2 minutes.\n• Transfer to a plate and cover to keep warm.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64d082cc7befbd431bc7536d-d8ffd7b0.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a good drizzle of olive oil. When oil is hot, cook tofu, turning occasionally, until golden, 5-7 minutes.\n• Remove from heat, then add hoisin mixture. Stir, then return cooked veggies to pan, tossing to coat. Season with pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64d082cc7befbd431bc7536d-7182bb9f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide garlic rice between bowls.\n• Top with hoisin tofu and veggie stir-fry.\n• Drizzle with sesame aioli and sprinkle with crispy shallots.\n• Serve with any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64d082cc7befbd431bc7536d-41ff4934.jpeg"
    }
  ]
